<title>SPAIN: Revised Spanish M4 figures for January.</title>
<headline>Revised Spanish M4 figures for January.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain, which earlier released provisional M4 figures for February, subsequently published revised data as follows:</p>
<p> MONEY SUPPLY		   Feb 97	Jan 97     Dec 96</p>
<p> M4 pct rise		     -1.3	  5.8	 9.3</p>
<p> Domestic credit pct rise    17.7	 20.6	 7.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Latest month's data are provisional. Previous are both revised. Percentage monthly rises are on annualised basis</p>
</text>
